# DE Desk design

Primary file: `client/src/components/ZohoASAPWidget.tsx`. Full playbook: `.cursor/skills/de-desk-ui/SKILL.md`.

## Shell (all tabs)

- One **dark glass** frame for Desk / Ticket / Resources — shared header, underline tabs, status row, footer.
- Brand magenta `#D3126A`; violet `#5B45E0` / `#7c3aed` accents; soft magenta/violet radial glow — no generic purple-on-white SaaS look.
- Active tab: pink/magenta label + glowing underline. Inactive: muted white/45.
- High contrast text always. Never white-on-white (`outline` Button needs explicit `bg-*` on dark pages).

## Tab content

| Tab | Panel inside shell |
|-----|--------------------|
| **Resources** | Dark nested cards — **approved reference**. Hero + tagged resource rows + security CTA. |
| **Desk** | **Light nested chat card** (readable bubbles/chips/composer) inside the dark shell. |
| **Ticket** | **Dark nested panel** matching Resources language (hero, quick chips, form card, optional ask bar). |

Do not invent a third unrelated theme per tab. Elevate in place; ask DE before removing CTAs, tabs, disclaimers, or resource links.

## Copy

- Label **functions**, not vendor products (e.g. “Remote session”, not “Zoho Assist”).
- Keep links/endpoints; change visible titles/tags only.
- Portal login via `PORTAL_LOGIN` — never invent `//login`.

## Logic

Preserve chat send/poll, agent live, ticket submit, resources links, analytics, ASAP bootstrap, cookie offset, `de-open-msp-advisor`. Visual restyle only unless DE asks for behavior change.
